    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Invitations and suggestions",
     "texto": [
      "**Masz ochotę na…?** means «do you fancy…?». To suggest an activity, **możemy** («we can») with the infinitive is also used.",
      "The imperative is used for direct invitations: **przyjdź** («come»). **Niestety** softens a negative reply: «unfortunately»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
